  "update_count": 57,
  "description_snippet": "**VULNERABILITY DETAILS**   \nThere's a bug in libxslt which can result in use-after-free in connection with the <xsl:strip-space> feature. Under certain circumstances, function xsltApplyTemplates can delete text nodes which are still referenced from variables, keys or possibly other data structures."
